     *

     * @return A sequential {@code Stream} with this collection as its source.

     * @since 1.9.0

     */

    public Stream<CSVRecord> stream() {

        return StreamSupport.stream(Spliterators.spliteratorUnknownSize(iterator(), Spliterator.ORDERED), false);

    }



